Tsugaru is an emulator of legendary Fujitsu FM TOWNS computer including Marty.

The goal is to emulate model II MX, which was the last computer I pledged
allegiance. Also I am trying to find and document undocumented features of
FM TOWNS system as much as possible while writing the emulator.

If you do not own your FM TOWNS hardware, you can use the following free
version of the ROM:

http://ysflight.com/FM/towns/FreeTOWNS/e.html
